usage: capcov discover [-h] [--target TARGET] [--source SOURCE]
                       [--adapter ADAPTER] [--quiet] [--out OUT] [--check]
                       [--no-name-match] [--resolver {ast,scip}]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --target TARGET       the project root
  --source SOURCE       source root under --target
  --adapter ADAPTER
  --quiet
  --out OUT
  --check               re-derive and diff
  --no-name-match       resolve calls through imports only; report every name-
                        match as residue
  --resolver {ast,scip}
                        call-graph resolver: 'ast' (default, hand-rolled,
                        stdlib-only) or 'scip' (type-aware cross-file; needs a
                        SCIP indexer + the scip CLI). The AST pass runs either
                        way and stays the blind-spot enumerator.
